    [25502]={name="Lightbearer's Gauntlets",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Marking the Path” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="Marking the Path",lore="With the rock flayer population thinned, all that's left is to signal the safe path to our pilgrims. Return to the Great Fissure with this torch and seek the three beacons that mark the path from the east."},
    [25541]={name="Cenarion Ring of Casting",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Lost in Action” — pick it over the other choices. In Coilfang Reservoir.",zone="Coilfang Reservoir",questName="Lost in Action",lore="You have to help me! We were sent here by Ysiel to investigate the mystery of the steam pumps and why they're being used to drain the water from the marsh."},
    [25597]={name="Vindicator's Cinch",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “An Unnatural Drought” — pick it over the other choices. In Zangarmarsh.",zone="Zangarmarsh",questName="An Unnatural Drought",lore="The soil sample you brought me is nearly devoid of moisture. If the soil itself is losing moisture, then the creatures that live in the Dead Mire must be suffering terribly."},
    [25606]={name="Burning Blade Cultist Band",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Message to Telaar” — pick it over the other choices. In Nagrand.",zone="Nagrand",questName="Message to Telaar",lore="You have single-handedly saved my clan from extermination. You may tell your leader that Lantresor of the Burning Blade and his Boulderfist ogres accept the offering of peace."},
    [25607]={name="Burning Blade Cultist Band",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Message to Garadar” — pick it over the other choices. In Nagrand.",zone="Nagrand",questName="Message to Garadar",lore="You have single-handedly saved my clan from extermination. You may tell your leader that Lantresor of the Burning Blade and his Boulderfist ogres accept the offering of peace."},
    [25615]={name="Feralfen Champion's Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Messenger to the Feralfen” — pick it over the other choices. In Zangarmarsh.",zone="Zangarmarsh",questName="Messenger to the Feralfen",lore="The time has come for us to embrace the Feralfen and teach them that the Light has not forsaken them."},
    [25644]={name="Blessed Book of Nagrand",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Ultimate Bloodsport” — pick it over the other choices. In Nagrand.",zone="Nagrand",questName="The Ultimate Bloodsport",lore="The queen of all that dwell in Nagrand is known as Tusker."},
    [25701]={name="Breastplate of Retribution",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Blood is Life” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Citadel.",zone="Hellfire Citadel",questName="The Blood is Life",lore="That letter is going to get folks all riled up around here. They'll think there's something we might do about all those new fel orcs being created if only we knew how it was being done."},
    [25712]={name="Perfectly Balanced Cape",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Heart of Rage” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Citadel.",zone="Hellfire Citadel",questName="Heart of Rage",lore="put together a force to investigate the Blood Furnace inside Hellfire Citadel at once! And that means today, princess! The magic we have at our disposal indicates that something unnatural is occurring in there."},
    [25715]={name="Jade Warrior Pauldrons",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Weaken the Ramparts” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Citadel.",zone="Hellfire Citadel",questName="Weaken the Ramparts",lore="Quick, there isn't much time. Thrallmar's existence balances on the razor's edge! We're caught between Hellfire Citadel in the west and the Burning Legion to the east."},
    [25716]={name="Handguards of Precision",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Weaken the Ramparts” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Citadel.",zone="Hellfire Citadel",questName="Weaken the Ramparts",lore="Quick, there isn't much time. Thrallmar's existence balances on the razor's edge! We're caught between Hellfire Citadel in the west and the Burning Legion to the east."},
    [25784]={name="Imbued Chain",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “A Job for an Intelligent Man” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="A Job for an Intelligent Man",lore="As if the gan'arg that overran the mines aren't bad enough, now we've got gigantic worms encroaching on us from the other direction!"},
    [25788]={name="Dauntless Handguards",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Fel Embers” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Citadel.",zone="Hellfire Citadel",questName="Fel Embers",lore="The stuffy academics of Azeroth have cowered in their towers for too long and it's fallen to me to show them what cutting edge research is!"},
    [25789]={name="Rune-Engraved Belt",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Fel Embers” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Citadel.",zone="Hellfire Citadel",questName="Fel Embers",lore="The stuffy academics of Azeroth have cowered in their towers for too long and it's fallen to me to show them what cutting edge research is!"},
    [25790]={name="Expedition Scout's Epaulets",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Fel Embers” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Citadel.",zone="Hellfire Citadel",questName="Fel Embers",lore="The stuffy academics of Azeroth have cowered in their towers for too long and it's fallen to me to show them what cutting edge research is!"},
    [25791]={name="Gloves of Preservation",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Fel Embers” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Citadel.",zone="Hellfire Citadel",questName="Fel Embers",lore="The stuffy academics of Azeroth have cowered in their towers for too long and it's fallen to me to show them what cutting edge research is!"},
    [25792]={name="Curate's Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Fel Embers” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Citadel.",zone="Hellfire Citadel",questName="Fel Embers",lore="The stuffy academics of Azeroth have cowered in their towers for too long and it's fallen to me to show them what cutting edge research is!"},
    [25805]={name="Mantle of Vivification",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Turning the Tide” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Citadel.",zone="Hellfire Citadel",questName="Turning the Tide",lore="The permanence of the orcish threat is one of the sad truths of Outland. There was a time when we Sons of Lothar believed we'd purchased Honor Hold's safety with our blood, but there was to be no peace."},
    [25819]={name="Breastplate of the Warbringer",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Forge Camp: Annihilated” — pick it over the other choices. In Nagrand.",zone="Nagrand",questName="Forge Camp: Annihilated",lore="Gather your allies. You will need them if you are to face an overseer. Once you have a suitable group, find and kill the overseers at each camp."},
    [25914]={name="Broken Choker",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Source of the Corruption” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="Source of the Corruption",lore="Uncorrupted draenei, like this unlucky fellow here, are virtuous champions of the Light. What corruption caused their great race to devolve into the Broken and Lost Ones?"},
    [25919]={name="Sedai's Necklace",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Makuru's Vengeance” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="Makuru's Vengeance",lore="Sedai was like a brother to Makuru. We owe him our lives and more! They call Makuru crazy but if the Omenai are not going to do anything about his death then they're the crazy ones!"},
    [25927]={name="Consortium Cloak of the Quick",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “A Personal Favor” — pick it over the other choices. In Terokkar Forest.",zone="Terokkar Forest",questName="A Personal Favor",lore="Hmmm? A box you say? Or was it several? Do you know what material the box was constructed from? And what was the name of this merchant? Empoor?"},
    [25937]={name="Terokkar Tablet of Precision",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Torgos!” — pick it over the other choices. In Terokkar Forest.",zone="Terokkar Forest",questName="Torgos!",lore="There's a creature in the Bone Wastes so fearsome that only the dauntless dare to stalk him. I speak of Torgos, king of the bonelashers, who circles over Veil Rhaze on the western edge of the wastes.",proc="Use: Increases attack power by 140 for 15 sec. (1 Min, 30 Sec Cooldown)"},
    [25945]={name="Cloak of Revival",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Tavarok in Mana-Tombs.",zone="Mana-Tombs",npc="Tavarok"},
    [25956]={name="Nexus-Bracers of Vigor",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Nexus-Prince Shaffar in Mana-Tombs.",zone="Mana-Tombs",npc="Nexus-Prince Shaffar"},
    [25957]={name="Ethereal Boots of the Skystrider",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Nexus-Prince Shaffar in Mana-Tombs.",zone="Mana-Tombs",npc="Nexus-Prince Shaffar"},
    [25962]={name="Longstrider's Loop",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Nexus-Prince Shaffar in Mana-Tombs.",zone="Mana-Tombs",npc="Nexus-Prince Shaffar"},
    [25979]={name="Flintlocke's Piloting Pants",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “In Case of Emergency...” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="In Case of Emergency...",lore="In the event of an emergency, it's always the pilot's job to keep a level head, especially when the only orders your co-pilot follows come from his stomach."},
    [25993]={name="Finely Wrought Chain",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “BETA Looking to the Leadership” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="BETA Looking to the Leadership",lore="The disturbances at Expedition Armory continue, despite your best efforts. No one truly knows everything that happened there, nor exactly what binds the spirits of the fallen soldiers to the ruins."},
    [26011]={name="Cryo-Core Attendant's Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Galaen's Fate” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="Galaen's Fate",lore="You have no means of identifying the corpse as Galaen with the information Morae gave you, but the clothing appears to have been torn in search of valuables."},
    [26012]={name="Kessel's Cinch Wrap",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Declaration of Power” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="Declaration of Power",lore="Have you seen the serpent men? The ones that call themselves naga? They dared make an advance upon this camp under cover of darkness only three nights ago."},
    [26013]={name="Cincture of Woven Reeds",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Culling the Flutterers” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="Culling the Flutterers",lore="When we first encountered flutterers, they showed few signs of mutation. As the corruption got progressively worse, the moths and other species began to show signs of contamination."},
    [26014]={name="Maatparm's Fungus Lined Cuffs",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Mac'Aree Mushroom Menagerie” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="Mac'Aree Mushroom Menagerie",lore="I am in need of mushrooms for my collection. Scattered throughout these unexplored wilds you will find four different types: An aquatic stinkhorn, a blood mushroom, a ruinous polyspore, and a fel cone fungus."},
    [26030]={name="Maatparm's Fungus Lined Hauberk",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Ysera's Tears” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="Ysera's Tears",lore="Good to see you again! You were exceptionally efficient in completing the last task that I offered you. Perhaps you would be interested in another?"},
    [26033]={name="Vindicator's Iron Legguards",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Matis the Cruel” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="Matis the Cruel",lore="Matis will be brought to justice,; and I want you to be the one to find him and bring him back to the Triumvirate. Scour the island for this bastard."},
    [26035]={name="Corin's Handguards",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Clearing the Way” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="Clearing the Way",lore="Only the most battle hardened, noble and positively fearless of draenei will submit to Legoso's mission. The exarch will not order any agent of the Hand to take on the task of destroying the Vector Coil and dispatching Sironas."},
    [26037]={name="Lightweight Mesh Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Galaen's Fate” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="Galaen's Fate",lore="You have no means of identifying the corpse as Galaen with the information Morae gave you, but the clothing appears to have been torn in search of valuables."},
    [26038]={name="Segmented Girdle",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Culling the Flutterers” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="Culling the Flutterers",lore="When we first encountered flutterers, they showed few signs of mutation. As the corruption got progressively worse, the moths and other species began to show signs of contamination."},
    [26039]={name="Kessel's Sturdy Riding Handle",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Declaration of Power” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="Declaration of Power",lore="Have you seen the serpent men? The ones that call themselves naga? They dared make an advance upon this camp under cover of darkness only three nights ago."},
    [26040]={name="Maatparm's Fungus Lined Bracers",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Mac'Aree Mushroom Menagerie” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="Mac'Aree Mushroom Menagerie",lore="I am in need of mushrooms for my collection. Scattered throughout these unexplored wilds you will find four different types: An aquatic stinkhorn, a blood mushroom, a ruinous polyspore, and a fel cone fungus."},
    [26050]={name="Fist of Argus",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Blood Watch” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="Blood Watch",lore="Blood Watch is one of two forward bases operated by the Hand of Argus."},
    [26054]={name="Blade of Argus",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Blood Watch” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="Blood Watch",lore="Blood Watch is one of two forward bases operated by the Hand of Argus."},
    [27400]={name="Peacekeeper's Buckler",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “WANTED: Deathclaw” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="WANTED: Deathclaw",lore="By order of Harbinger Mikolaas: A bounty of 18 silver to be paid to the brave soul who returns with proof of the marauding bear Deathclaw's demise."},
    [27408]={name="Hope Bearer Helm",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Shirrak the Dead Watcher in Auchenai Crypts.",zone="Auchenai Crypts",npc="Shirrak the Dead Watcher"},
    [27426]={name="Northshire Battlemace",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Captain Skarloc.",npc="Captain Skarloc"},
    [27434]={name="Mantle of Perenolde",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Epoch Hunter.",npc="Epoch Hunter"},
    [27436]={name="Iron Band of the Unbreakable",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lieutenant Drake.",npc="Lieutenant Drake"},
    [27520]={name="Greathelm of the Unbreakable",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Grand Warlock Nethekurse in The Shattered Halls.",zone="The Shattered Halls",npc="Grand Warlock Nethekurse"},
    [27525]={name="Jeweled Boots of Sanctification",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Warbringer O'mrogg in The Shattered Halls.",zone="The Shattered Halls",npc="Warbringer O'mrogg"},
    [27728]={name="Cushy Cenarion Walkers",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Leader of the Darkcrest” — pick it over the other choices. In Zangarmarsh.",zone="Zangarmarsh",questName="Leader of the Darkcrest",lore="A bounty is hereby declared by the Cenarion Expedition on Rajah Haghazed, leader of the Darkcrest naga."},
    [27731]={name="Vindicator's Cloak",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Zeth'Gor Must Burn!” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="Zeth'Gor Must Burn!",lore="The Bleeding Hollow clan have betrayed their noble heritage! We, the orcs who fought and died to save ourselves from the fel taint of Mannoroth, look upon our vile cousins and see only weakness and ignobility..."},
    [27788]={name="Bloodsworn Warboots",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Keli'dan the Breaker (1).",npc="Keli'dan the Breaker (1)"},
    [27792]={name="Steam-Hinge Chain of Valor",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Mekgineer Steamrigger in The Steamvault.",zone="The Steamvault",npc="Mekgineer Steamrigger"},
    [27884]={name="Ornate Boots of the Sanctified",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ambassador Hellmaw in Shadow Labyrinth.",zone="Shadow Labyrinth",npc="Ambassador Hellmaw"},
